core":3,"product_id":100063601,"comment_content":"我在工作中使用的协议主要分以下两种场景：\n1. 嵌入式设备向获取服务器资源的，使用请求 - 响应模式，一般是用HTTP实现。\n2. 嵌入式设备和服务器频繁通讯的，实时性要求强的，在请求 - 响应模式模式上使用长连接，一般是TCP和WebSocket实现。\n项目初期定制协议时，一般取决于云端服务器能提供什么协议，所以我只使用过发布 - 订阅模式。\n在后续学习过程中针对不同场景，尝试自己开发适合的通讯协议服务器。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2302171,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/23/20/db/b04f43dc.jpg","nickname":"郭朝斌","note":"","ucode":"2969986E1B3851","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":509413,"discussion_content":"������","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1605270401,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":356970,"user_name":"抱紧我的小鲤鱼","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1014603,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"139780FB860FA3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/7b/4b/95812b15.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1662762937,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100063601,"comment_content":"zigbee？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":353208,"user_name":"Geek_7jwpfc","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1318633,"ip_address":"湖南","ucode":"CBCEA76E9EF33B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/0.png","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1659263128,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100063601,"comment_content":"“虽然 AMQP 协议拥有庞大的特性集，比较重，不适合计算资源有限、对功耗要求严苛的物联网设备，但是它可以满足后台系统对于可靠性和可扩展性的要求”；老师，请问这句话怎么理解？“后台系统”这句话怎么理解，是web后台管理系统吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":337398,"user_name":"Geek_58f